{"5017500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Galleries", "steam_appid": 5017500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Endless Virtual Galleries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for anything — Japan, birds, space, architecture, or your own photos — and step into a procedurally generated virtual museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through quiet galleries, inspect any image to learn more about it, and follow related tags to generate the next exhibition. One discovery leads naturally to another:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japan → Temple → Buddha → Thailand → Beach → Surfing</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Museum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your personal photographs and turn them into a walkable gallery. Vacation photos, family memories, artwork, or your photography collection — all become spaces you can explore at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calm Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no objectives, timers, or scores. Just wander, look, and follow your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Generate unique galleries from any search topic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspect images for title, photographer and related tags</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Follow tags to create endless new galleries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Import and explore your own photo folders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open the original photographer’s page from the game</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Endless Virtual Galleries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for anything — Japan, birds, space, architecture, or your own photos — and step into a procedurally generated virtual museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through quiet galleries, inspect any image to learn more about it, and follow related tags to generate the next exhibition. One discovery leads naturally to another:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japan → Temple → Buddha → Thailand → Beach → Surfing</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Museum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your personal photographs and turn them into a walkable gallery. Vacation photos, family memories, artwork, or your photography collection — all become spaces you can explore at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calm Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no objectives, timers, or scores. Just wander, look, and follow your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Generate unique galleries from any search topic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspect images for title, photographer and related tags</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Follow tags to create endless new galleries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Import and explore your own photo folders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open the original photographer’s page from the game</p>", "short_description": "Explore infinite virtual museums generated from any topic.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5017500/9b866512b4d42e71dcdbfdfa81e0b4b44dfb48aa/header.jpg?t=1786034841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5017500/d36246dda396c5a9d014d7ca6eea54f651476afa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786034841", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5017500/d36246dda396c5a9d014d7ca6eea54f651476afa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786034841", "website": "http://www.nannings.nz", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong